00:04:29.936 --> 00:04:34.796
Vendus and Botanical Garden. Green Commissioner Tom Digby, the only incumbent is

00:04:34.796 --> 00:04:38.256
the first chair, and Cope's Satia Burton is the first vice chair.

00:04:38.676 --> 00:04:44.256
