00:04:57.456 --> 00:05:02.256
The pause on the Vancouver Aquatic Center is over, and interim injunction expired Tuesday,

00:05:02.256 --> 00:05:07.036
and CBC says demolition goes ahead later this month as part of a controversial renovation

00:05:07.036 --> 00:05:13.483
that includes a 25-meter pool. West Vancouver has a new mayor, and Kirk Lapointe used the first

00:05:13.483 --> 00:05:18.143
speech of the job. He and the new council were sworn in Monday evening, November 2nd,

00:05:18.283 --> 00:05:23.123
to promise a greater voice in decisions, careful spending, and room for more people to build lives

00:05:23.123 --> 00:05:27.983
there. He defeated incumbent Mark Sager last month. His working life has been newsrooms,

00:05:27.983 --> 00:05:34.123
Managing editor of the Vancouver Sun, executive editor of the National Post, CBC's Ombudsman

00:05:34.123 --> 00:05:38.883
