00:05:43.563 --> 00:05:47.763
He has taught journalism at the University of British Columbia, and he lives in Callfield.

00:05:48.263 --> 00:05:53.783
In 2014, he ran for Vancouver Mayor with the Nonpartisan Association against Gregor Robertson

00:05:53.783 --> 00:05:58.843
and lost. The campaign promises, which are promises and not yet policy, were to bring

00:05:58.843 --> 00:06:05.503
the projected 2027 tax increase down from nearly 7% to 3%, then cap annual municipal spending

00:06:05.503 --> 00:06:10.843
growth at half the inflation rate. He promised to eliminate municipal pay-parking, to revitalize

00:06:10.843 --> 00:06:15.723
Ambleside, Dunderrave, Horseshoe Bay and Callfield, and to ask the province for permission

00:06:15.723 --> 00:06:20.523
