00:06:25.503 --> 00:06:29.383
An urgent and primary care center was his first pick for a public-private partnership.

00:06:29.843 --> 00:06:34.743
He also proposed arts, skating, and seniors facilities, restoring advisory committees,

00:06:35.163 --> 00:06:38.943
